{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798630/extras/Sumerian_cosmology_infographic.gif?t=1751679368\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Before humanity existed, Earth was ruled by the Existentials: colossal conscious beings capable of shaping reality. They created lesser races to serve them\u2014but not all accepted that fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Some chose to rebel.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bereshipsis</strong> is a turn-based tactical RPG where you lead a team of rebellious Existentials determined to defy their creators and prevent the end of the world. Choose wisely, act strategically, and face a collapsing future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798630/extras/hidden_Sumerian_truth.gif?t=1751679368\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Move your team across a hexagonal board. Push enemies across the map, turn invisible, upgrade your attacks and skills, teleport, and even control your enemies if you wish!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798630/extras/mage-fireball-skill-tree.gif?t=1751679368\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your story decisions truly matter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mostly developed by a solo creator.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">10 playable characters with unique styles, mechanics, and upgrade paths offering multiple playstyles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Limited vision applies to both you and your enemies. Use skills, items, or attacks to reveal more... but enemies can too.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 save slots.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each Existential has one or two \u201cFormalities\u201d. Like rock-paper-scissors, each one has an advantage over another. Choose from Colossus, Predator, Invader, Occultist, Analyst, Acrobat, and Shifter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Handcrafted pixel art filled with love and chaos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">11 unique challenges.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3798630?t=1751679368","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3798630?t=1751679368","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798630/2c396f12b16dc7db46d18630cacf4205fe7fe0cd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751679368","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798630/2c396f12b16dc7db46d18630cacf4205fe7fe0cd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751679368","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798630/extras/Sumerian_cosmology_infographic.gif?t=1751679368\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Before humanity existed, Earth was ruled by the Existentials: colossal conscious beings capable of shaping reality. They created lesser races to serve them\u2014but not all accepted that fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Some chose to rebel.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bereshipsis</strong> is a turn-based tactical RPG where you lead a team of rebellious Existentials determined to defy their creators and prevent the end of the world. Choose wisely, act strategically, and face a collapsing future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798630/extras/hidden_Sumerian_truth.gif?t=1751679368\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Move your team across a hexagonal board. Push enemies across the map, turn invisible, upgrade your attacks and skills, teleport, and even control your enemies if you wish!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798630/extras/mage-fireball-skill-tree.gif?t=1751679368\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your story decisions truly matter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mostly developed by a solo creator.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">10 playable characters with unique styles, mechanics, and upgrade paths offering multiple playstyles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Limited vision applies to both you and your enemies. Use skills, items, or attacks to reveal more... but enemies can too.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 save slots.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each Existential has one or two \u201cFormalities\u201d. Like rock-paper-scissors, each one has an advantage over another. Choose from Colossus, Predator, Invader, Occultist, Analyst, Acrobat, and Shifter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Handcrafted pixel art filled with love and chaos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">11 unique challenges.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Vic"],"genres":[{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/app